Template: plainnvr/mirror-disks
Type: multiselect
Choices: ${DISKS}
Description: Select exactly two drives for the PlainNVR boot mirror:
 The selected drives will hold identical system and recording partitions.
 Review their names, models and sizes carefully. The installer will ask for
 confirmation before writing the partition tables. All existing data on
 these two drives will be erased if you approve those changes.

Template: plainnvr/mirror-invalid
Type: note
Description: Choose exactly two eligible drives
 Both drives must be at least 36 GB. The installation medium cannot be used.
